121
00:07:19,239 --> 00:07:19,919
But...

122
00:07:19,919 --> 00:07:20,539
Wait!

123
00:07:20,959 --> 00:07:22,719
That was my...

124
00:07:22,719 --> 00:07:23,879
I'm rolling so much!

125
00:07:24,059 --> 00:07:25,199
She gave me a fright.

126
00:07:25,379 --> 00:07:27,039
I nearly wet me knickers.

127
00:07:27,499 --> 00:07:29,159
Yeah, that number two girl's hardcore!

128
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:30,739
That guy's lucky!

129
00:07:30,739 --> 00:07:31,399
Hmm?

130
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:34,939
Oh, yeah, oh, yeah, oh, yeah!

131
00:07:35,059 --> 00:07:37,059
Oh, yeah, oh, yeah, oh, yeah!

132
00:07:37,199 --> 00:07:38,139
Oh, oh!

133
00:07:38,239 --> 00:07:38,739
Excuse me?

134
00:07:40,279 --> 00:07:41,779
Um, there's trouble!

135
00:07:41,779 --> 00:07:49,599
We told you no touching the talent!

136
